# L set, kernel 04. Enderby and Baracskai, DAFx-12, eq. (4): two-stage quadratic soft clipping (TSQ).
# y = sgn(x) for |x| > 2/3; sgn(x) (3 - (2 - 3|x|)^2) / 3 for 1/3 <= |x| <= 2/3; 2x for |x| < 1/3.
x = in * 2.0
a = abs(x)
s = if(x < 0, -1.0, 1.0)
y = if(a > 0.6667, s, if(a >= 0.3333, s * (3.0 - (2.0 - 3.0 * a) * (2.0 - 3.0 * a)) / 3.0, 2.0 * x))
out = y * 0.5
